  "title": "The MacBook Pro now has a touchscreen",
  "caption": "The MacBook Pro now has a touchscreen. 💻\n\nApple's new MacBook Pro with PROLED XDR Display has a tandem OLED screen you can scroll, pinch and draw on, plus a Dynamic Island at the top for Spotlight, Live Activities and Siri. It comes with M5 Pro or M5 Max, starts at $2,899 (14-inch) and $3,399 (16-inch) in the US, and arrives from 6 November. The MacBook Pro without touch is still on sale for less, so try the touch model in a store before you pay extra.\nSend this to a friend who's about to buy a Mac.",
